etics to survive the dangers of the sky.\n\n# Explore Floating Island Biomes\nTravel through cloud forests, volcanic peaks, frozen skylands, and ancient ruins. Every biome challenges you in new ways\u2014and rewards you with rare loot.\n\n# Hunt Monsters with Friends\nTeam up to track powerful creatures, defeat roaming threats, and gather valuable drops. Cooperation means bigger hunts and better rewards.\n\n# Mine, Gather, and Discover\nDig through hidden caves, mine rare ores, and uncover secrets spread across the floating frontier. Bring everything back to the safe-zone castle to trade, upgrade, and grow stronger.\n\n# Expand with Every Update\nNew islands, monsters, gadgets, and surprises arrive regularly, expanding the world and pushing your adventure even further.\n\n**Rise through the skies. Serve the kingdom. Become Zibby.**", "short_description": "Explore floating island biomes as Zibby, servant of the kingdom. Team up with friends to hunt monsters, mine rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast sky-realm. Collect valuable drops, sell them in the castle safe zone, and upgrade your gear. New islands, enemies, and tools arrive with every update\u2014your adventure never stops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics